1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,108
'ok.' With
the period.

2
00:00:03,172 --> 00:00:04,592
Congratulations.

3
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,078
You're in trouble.

4
00:00:06,098 --> 00:00:07,612
They typed 'ok'.

5
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:08,884
Paused.

6
00:00:08,904 --> 00:00:10,696
Went back for
the period.

7
00:00:10,716 --> 00:00:12,802
Nobody does that
by accident.

8
00:00:12,822 --> 00:00:14,126
Same question.

9
00:00:14,146 --> 00:00:15,618
Three answers.

10
00:00:15,638 --> 00:00:16,988
One is a threat.

11
00:00:17,008 --> 00:00:18,462
'okay': happy.

12
00:00:18,482 --> 00:00:19,872
'ok': busy.

13
00:00:19,892 --> 00:00:22,252
'ok.': you
forgot something.

14
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,740
Good luck.

15
00:00:23,788 --> 00:00:25,128
Except.

16
00:00:25,256 --> 00:00:27,438
One kind of person
breaks this rule.

17
00:00:27,458 --> 00:00:28,542
Dads.

18
00:00:28,562 --> 00:00:29,710
Bosses.

19
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,910
People who sign
their texts.

20
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:34,266
Their 'ok.'
is just 'ok'.

21
00:00:34,286 --> 00:00:35,508
Pattern first.

22
00:00:35,528 --> 00:00:36,676
Now you.

23
00:00:36,696 --> 00:00:37,784
A…

24
00:00:37,804 --> 00:00:39,184
or B?

25
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:40,592
Careful.

26
00:00:40,612 --> 00:00:42,772
One of them
is your dad.

27
00:00:43,716 --> 00:00:44,776
A.

28
00:00:44,796 --> 00:00:47,004
First period
she's ever used.

29
00:00:47,024 --> 00:00:48,406
Dad's just Dad.

30
00:00:48,426 --> 00:00:49,478
Bonus.

31
00:00:49,498 --> 00:00:51,966
A lone 'k' is
a door closing.

32
00:00:51,986 --> 00:00:53,506
On your face.

33
00:00:54,014 --> 00:00:54,674
Two of seven:

34
00:00:54,694 --> 00:00:56,414
left on read.

